        "text": "- About Narayan\n- Issues\n- Photos\n- Contribute\n- Contact\n# Join Our Campaign\nJoin Us — Volunteer Your Time, Share Your Skills, or Contribute.\nSign up to receive the latest news and updates.\nFirst name Email Zip/Postal Phone Message\nBy providing your phone number you consent to receive messages. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Text STOP to opt out.\nThank you for signing up!\n# Why I’m Running\nI believe Livermore is ready for a new chapter — one where we continue to focus on the issues that matter most to our community, where every resident feels heard, and where everyone has a stake in our shared future.\nI’m running for Livermore City Council, District 2, because I believe in Livermore and its future. With thoughtful leadership that listens, brings people together, and puts our community first, we can preserve what makes Livermore special while addressing today’s challenges and preparing responsibly for tomorrow.\nMake a Donation\n$10 $25 $50 $100 $250 $500 $1000 Other\nSign Up for Updates\nFirst name Last name Email Zip/Postal Message\nThanks for signing up!\n- Yard Signs\n- Photos\n- Contact\n- Privacy Policy\nPAID FOR BY:\nTadimeti for Livermore City Council 2026\nFPPC # 1495151\nPowered by CampaignPartner.com\n- Home\n- About Narayan\n- Issues\n- Contribute\n- Yard Signs\n- Contact\nClose Menu",
